      "hash64": "452959139DA13358",
      "text": "Oh! Well, if isn’t my pal [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\c\\nI’d actually love to grab your ear for something,\\nbut...just look at how many Pokémon you’ve got!\\c\\nThink you could make some space in your Boxes\\nor your team, then come talk to me again?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
