      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh, hello, hello, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nEnjoying\\r\\nthat\\r\\nschool\\r\\ntrip,\\r\\nare\\r\\nyou?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
